---
const issue = "https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-react-native/issues/6630";
const release = "https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-react-native/releases/tag/8.25.0";
---

<section id="upstream" class="upstream">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="label">Upstream</p>
    <h2>Bugs I found in production, fixed at the source</h2>

    <article>
      <h3>
        <a href={issue} rel="noopener">sentry-react-native #6630</a>
      </h3>

      <p>
        Sentry was silently dropping every log and span on iOS with React Native 0.86 and
        above, while still reporting HTTP&nbsp;200 &mdash; so error reporting looked healthy
        and collected nothing. I traced it to an unreliable
        <code>performance.timeOrigin</code>, reported it with a reproduction, and Sentry
        shipped the fix six days later.
      </p>

      <p class="shipped-in">
        Fixed in <a href={release} rel="noopener">8.25.0</a>
        <span class="quote">
          &ldquo;Prevent silently dropped logs and spans on iOS with React Native &ge; 0.86
          caused by an unreliable <code>performance.timeOrigin</code>&rdquo;
        </span>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .upstream {
    padding-block: var(--section-gap);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  h2 { margin-block: 0.75rem 2.5rem; max-width: 30ch; }

  article {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 2px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  h3 a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  h3 a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  article > p { color: var(--muted); }

  code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    background: var(--sunk);
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .shipped-in {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }

  .quote {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
